---
import Default from '@astrojs/starlight/components/Footer.astro';
const isZh = Astro.currentLocale === 'zh-CN';
---
<Default><slot /></Default>
<p class="feedback">
	<a href="https://github.com/huhao121/mausbotguide/issues/new" rel="noopener">
		{isZh ? '发现错误或内容过时？在 GitHub 上告诉我们' : 'Spotted a mistake or something out of date? Tell us on GitHub'}
	</a>
</p>
<p class="disclaimer">
	{isZh
		? 'MausBot Guide 是独立的非官方社区教程站，与 Supamaus Software Private Limited 无隶属关系。OpenMausBot、MausBot 名称及吉祥物是其各自所有者的商标。'
		: 'MausBot Guide is an independent, unofficial community guide and is not affiliated with Supamaus Software Private Limited. OpenMausBot, MausBot and the mascot are trademarks of their respective owner.'}
</p>
<style>
	.feedback {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
	}
	.disclaimer {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
</style>
